  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a medium saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced bell pepper and cook for 3 minutes.",
    "Add the sliced cucumber and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "In a separate saucepan, combine the coconut milk and ground cardamom.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer over medium heat.",
    "Add the cooked rice to the coconut milk mixture and stir to combine.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Stir in chopped cilantro and squeeze with fresh lime juice.",
    "Serve the rice bowl with the sautéed vegetables on top.",
